## Plants die. Not because of you.

Most people do not forget to care. They forget *when*, and they never learned *what*.

<step>
  <text anim=rise>
    Watering too much and too little look the same from the outside.
  </text>
</step>

<step>
  <text anim=zoom>
    **Result:** a shelf of expensive green regret.
  </text>
</step>
